{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791039694,"nonce":"52ukmiNtk0K5488g+JxGOom5fsY=","title":"A method lookup that misses mints a `Class.method` placeholder that becomes a trap stub","message":"Rows: Issue4653, Issue5351, Issue7334, Issue9745, Issue2889, Issue6043 (all `uncompiled \u003cClass\u003e.\u003cmethod\u003e`).\n\nWhen TAST `resolve_method_symbol` (tast/ast_lowering/expr/calls.rs) finds no member it creates a\nplaceholder Function symbol `\u003cRecvClass\u003e.\u003cname\u003e`; MIR `try_forward_declared_call`\n(ir/mir/expr/call/forward_ref.rs) links it to a function no module defines, and finalize installs a\ntrap stub. The miss has a different cause per row:\n- Issue4653: `@:genericBuild` is not implemented.\n- Issue5351: the entry class shares its bare name with an imported class's parent; the parent walk\n  (`parent_class_symbol` / `resolve_class_like_symbol_by_name` picking `matches[0]`) misses the\n  inherited method. Behind it: a ctor-less class whose parent is imported from another package has\n  no constructor (sig_index `qualify_parent` tries only its own package), and an override in the entry\n  file of an imported class's method is bound statically.\n- Issue7334: a field `dispatch:T` of `Base\u003cT\u003e` is not substituted through `extends Base\u003cInt-\u003eVoid\u003e`\n  (`resolve_function_typed_field` substitutes only the receiver's own type args). Behind it, calling\n  a capturing closure through an instance field passes no env (segfault 0x7).\n- Issue9745: `@:resolve`/`@:op(a.b)` applies to field reads and writes in HIR but not to a call\n  `a.field()`.\n- Issue2889: a method of a GENERIC typedef (`Mappable\u003cY\u003e = {function map..}`) over an Array value.\n- Issue6043: a method inherited from a cross-module superclass two levels up (Input.readLine via\n  BytesInput -\u003e StringInput); behind it, \"no vtable registered\" for a class two levels below a\n  cross-module base.\n\nA missing member should be a compile error, not a silent stub.","files":null}]}